1215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 389 0 R
/T (Boxing and kickboxing are sports found to burn the most calories per hour. Most gyms have a punch bag or an open space to practice technique. The good thing about boxing is it uses your intelligence to learn new combos. There is always a new combo to learn, so your cardio can be fun, intellectual and you can learn a skill instead of just repetitively running on a treadmill or doing a circuit. Boxing can be great for days where your brain needs some stimulation and normal cardio seems boring. )
/E (Boxing and kickboxing are sports found to burn the most calories per hour. Most gyms have a punch bag or an open space to practice technique. The good thing about boxing is it uses your intelligence to learn new combos. There is always a new combo to learn, so your cardio can be fun, intellectual and you can learn a skill instead of just repetitively running on a treadmill or doing a circuit. Boxing can be great for days where your brain needs some stimulation and normal cardio seems boring. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 389 0 R
/T (  If Boxing is not your thing, then your aim of this month is to go and try a new sport for at least 30minutes to an hour on your cardio days. You can run around shooting  Basketball hoops, give Rock Climbing  a try or go to a Swimming lesson. The aim is to find a form of cardio you genuinely enjoy, because then you will never have an issue sticking to cardio in your programming again. )
/E (  If Boxing is not your thing, then your aim of this month is to go and try a new sport for at least 30minutes to an hour on your cardio days. You can run around shooting  Basketball hoops, give Rock Climbing  a try or go to a Swimming lesson. The aim is to find a form of cardio you genuinely enjoy, because then you will never have an issue sticking to cardio in your programming again. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
