/Title (Implement a heavy day once a week, where you do 4 sets of 5 repetitions at a heavier weight than you would in your 8 - 12 rep range. This helps you build strength if you are struggling to get that extra rep each week in the 8 - 12 rep range. After you reach 3 sets of 12 on an exercise you can go up in weight. Iff you struggle to add extra reps each week, then 1 heavy day per week can work.)
